@startuml analyze_path
title analyze_path (from src/core/bean_vuln_cli_backup.py)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
package core {
  class analyze_path <<function>> {
    + analyze_path(p: Path, recursive: bool, keep: bool, export_dir: Path = None)
  }
}

note right of analyze_path
Analyzes a Path (file, directory, or csv) and delegates to analyze_vul4j_csv,
analyze_directory, or direct Java file analysis using the IntegratedGNNFramework.
Returns a result dict including 'cpg' and 'technical_details'.
end note

@enduml
